 "headline": "Fears And Acuff Feast While Mambas Starve",
 "notes": [
  "Suggs to be you leads White Mambas 10-1 right now, and Kingston Flemings went 1-4 for two points like he wanted that margin personally.",
  "Acinonyx just took FG% from LeParth James, and Precious Achiuwa's 12-of-17 with 4 steals is why they're not already trailing 4-6.",
  "LeParth James got Onyeka Okongwu's 29 points and 11-of-17 shooting, then let Damian Lillard burn it back at 3-of-13.",
  "Gopher Gold coughed up AST to MONSTARS and now leads 7-4, with Zion Williamson's 22 points and 5 steals the lone adult in the room.",
  "Thug Life leads Adam Silver Dez Nuts 8-3 with Jeremiah Fears posting 22, 8 and 13 while the opposition counts Cedric Coward's steals for comfort."
 ]
